; +-----------------------------------------+
; Nyao Scalper v51.0 - DEFAULT PROFILE
; © Copyright Nyao Scalper by Elriz Wiraswara
; +-----------------------------------------+
; D1-trend entries + checkpoint exit + trailing stop (= the EA's built-in input defaults).
; EXPERIMENTAL - backtested only; demo forward-test before using real money.
; Built for gold quoted with 3 decimals (XAUUSDm), hedge OFF. Attach it to an M5 chart.
; Point values are written for 3-decimal gold quotes (PointInputDigits=3) and rescaled automatically:
; where gold is quoted with 2 decimals, 20000 points become 2000, the same $20 move.
;   Entry : trend score >= 5 (the multi-hour trend agrees), only in the D1 trend direction
;           (close at least 0.5% beyond a rising / falling EMA50).
;   Stop  : fixed $20 move (20000 points on 3-decimal quotes).
;   Size  : the largest lot that loses at most 1.25% at the stop (RiskPerTradePct), max 0.05 lot:
;           0.01 lot on $2,000 (about 1%), 0.05 lot on a $100 cent account (10,000 cents).
;           When even 0.01 lot risks more than 1.25%, it is still traded up to 5% (MaxRiskPerTradePct).
;   Exit  : +$20 is a checkpoint - score still agrees -> keep the trade, lock 50% of the move,
;           next checkpoint $20 further; otherwise close.
;   Trail : once +$10 in profit (50% of the checkpoint distance), the SL follows the price
;           $20 behind (100% of it) and never moves back.
;   Flip  : a losing trade is closed early once the opposite score reaches 6 (the trend turned).
;   Pause : after 4 losses in a row, paper-trade until a paper win, then trade again.
; Backtest v50.0, $2,000 per month (each month a fresh run), 1.25% risk sizing (= 0.01 lot),
; sums of monthly returns:
;   Jan-Sep 2026, real ticks (reports/default-2026-real-ticks):
;     M5: +83.3%, 6/9 months up, worst month -3.1%, max DD 20.0%, PF 1.20
;         (Jan-Jun +85.8%, Jul-Sep -2.5%)
;     M1: +19.5%, 5/9 months up, worst month -17.8%, max DD 32.3%, PF 1.04
;   2025, ticks generated from 1-minute bars (reports/default-2025):
;     M5: +66.2%, 10/12 months up, worst month -2.2%, max DD 11.7%, PF 1.38
;     M1: +25.2%, 7/12 months up, worst month -3.9%, max DD 14.1%, PF 1.12
;   2022 / 2023 / 2024 on M5, generated ticks: -11.6% / -13.9% / +6.2%.
;   The profile makes its money when gold trends hard (2025-2026) and loses in sideways years.
;   It was designed on data that includes 2025-2026, so those years are not a blind test.
; Requirements / warnings:
;   - Account: $2,000+ standard recommended, or $100+ cent (balance in cents). On a standard
;     account below about $1,600 the 0.01 minimum lot risks more than 1.25%: it is still traded
;     down to about $400 (up to 5% per trade, orange Lot line on the dashboard), nothing below.
;   - Needs a hedging account (up to 2 positions open).
;   - Prefer M5: on M1 the same rules trade more often with deeper drawdowns.
; +-----------------------------------------+
